    "updated_at": "2026-04-11T08:43:22Z",
    "body": "In terms of implementation - one thing to watch out for is that removing the popover attribute would clear the popoverdata slot. So we should add a test for `.addEventListener('beforetoggle', e => e.target.showPopover())` but also `.addEventListener('beforetoggle', e => { e.target.removeAttribute('popover'); e.target.setAttribute('popover', ''); e.showPopover() })`.",
